WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:05.190
<i>I hate myself for no longer being human!</i>

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.650
<i>You will not leave this place alive.</i>

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:36.330
Mugai...

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:39.660
What does he mean you were 
leader of the Insect Hunters?

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:41.660
Did you...

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.580
kill my mother?!

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:54.380
<b>Kuroageha Arrives</b>

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.740
Did you kill her?!

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:10.040
This is great...

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.310
Fighting each other?

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.070
Well, he did once lead the Insect Hunters.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.900
You two have fun.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.800
I have something to do...

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:20.580
Bye!

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.310
<i>Why?</i>

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.250
<i>What is this?</i>

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:12.470
<i>Instead of the Insect Hunters
 who are hunting me,</i>

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:17.000
<i>I can only think 
of this Tsukishima.</i>

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.630
Miss, I will handle this!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.480
<i>Oh... I understand.</i>

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:27.390
<i>This Tsukishima...</i>

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:32.680
<i>When I fought the Insect Hunters, 
I moved away from him.</i>

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.450
<i>My poison brings death to any it touches,</i>

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.530
<i>be they friend or foe.</i>

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.620
<i>He must realize this,</i>

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:44.530
<i>and so he interfered whenever 
I tried to use my poison.</i>

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:50.330
<i>And above all, the enemy hasn't hurt him.</i>

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:54.210
<i>And it explains what happened back then.</i>

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:57.760
<i>I'm sure of it.</i>

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.550
<i>This Tsukishima must be a spy,</i>

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:06.730
<i>sent by the Insect Hunters to prevent 
me from using my power.</i>

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.270
Tsukishima, I need to ask you something.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.350
Are you with the Insect Hunters―

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.400
You're in the way, insect.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:27.530
Tsukishima isn't one of you?

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.870
What are you talking about?

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:37.550
Stop moving around!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.840
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Counter!</i>

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:55.100
Run away while there's still time, miss.

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:59.670
And tell the Insect Magistrate that, together,

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:02.110
we can look at the sky in Edo!

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.110
That insect is irritating me.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.450
Understood.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:17.880
Hey, kid.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:18.610
Take this!

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:19.630
<i>Stabbing Needle Blade!</i>

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.470
He's too fast...

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:33.390
In your next life, choose a better occupation.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.650
<i>Purgatory's Spear!</i>

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:50.260
M-Miss...

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:53.260
I'll hold them off here...

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.330
Tsukishima!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:38.480
Mugai, you aren't playing fair.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:42.390
If you do that, I can't kill you.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:46.750
I know you didn't kill my mother.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:51.870
However, as former leader
 of the Insect Hunters,

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.300
you can tell me it was.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:57.560
This is not the time for that.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:03.000
You really aren't fair at all...

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:04.500
Let's go.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.850
Come on... Wait!

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:22.470
He really is not one of you?

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:24.080
I've never seen the kid before.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.330
I see...

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:33.840
Insect Hunters, would you give me some time?

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.470
What? Hell, no!

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:37.600
Stay back.

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.600
Hey, leader... What are you doing?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.610
Right now, this may be the smarter course.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:57.370
<i>What was I thinking?</i>

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:01.620
<i>He merely wished to protect me,</i>

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.690
<i>using the little power he had...</i>

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:10.110
<i>So why did I doubt him, 
even for a single moment?</i>

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.390
<i>Why could I not believe his words?</i>

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.480
<i>I'm sorry, Tsukishima...</i>

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:22.640
<i>I stopped being human long ago.</i>

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:29.330
<i>My poison kills anyone who makes 
direct contact with my body.</i>

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:35.910
<i>That is why they gave me the 
position of Insect Magistrate.</i>

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:39.100
<i>They fear me... They hate me.</i>

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.160
<i>And in the end, they try to use me.</i>

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:43.200
<i>I convinced myself</i>

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:47.020
<i>that all they did or said were 
attempts to manipulate me.</i>

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:52.050
<i>A long, long time ago, 
I abandoned human warmth.</i>

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:57.730
<i>And without that warmth, 
my heart froze.</i>

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:04.420
Now I understand why I couldn't 
stop thinking about him.

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:13.600
I simply didn't want to hurt him...

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:20.160
He must have been so very warm.

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:29.260
I hate myself for no longer being human!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:44.430
You will not leave this place alive.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:50.960
This cloth keeps out the poison 
that leaks from my body.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:54.230
Now, it will protect you instead.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:55.860
Enough talk!

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:59.290
Show yourself for what you are, Kuroageha!

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:32.650
Kuroageha...

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:37.650
I will take your puny souls...

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.470
and crush them into dust.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:44.740
Here it comes!

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:52.600
Is that her power?

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:54.710
<i>Stabbing Needle Blade: High Speed!</i>

00:10:58.480 --> 00:10:59.470
It melted!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.190
This monster is immortal.

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:05.100
She was playing with us, 
like we were kittens.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.950
If you understand that much,

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:10.100
then prepare for your destruction.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.360
Kaina... Gaikotsu!

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:15.800
Do it.

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:22.510
Evil Insect-Slaying Blade, Insect Hunter,

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:23.700
ready to fire.

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:25.500
Fire, Kaina!

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:31.420
It's useless.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.670
No attack can touch me.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:41.510
Did you think that little trick 
would work on me?

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.770
<i>The front blade made it through intact?</i>

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:55.040
<i>What is this?</i>

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:03.470
What's going on?

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.080
My power is fading...

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:27.300
The tiny red blade that pierced your chest

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:31.180
was the Evil Insect-Slaying Blade, Insect Hunter.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.620
Well, Insect Magistrate?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:36.690
Could you feel our hate 
emanating from that blade?

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:39.500
That tiny blade, Insect Hunter,

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:44.130
is what is left of a blade
 nearly twelve feet long.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:47.730
We melted and reforged it over and over,

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:50.590
mixing it with skeletons of 670 insect types,

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:53.460
increasing its power to the limits of possibility.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:57.660
It's been a very long time 
since we began forging it,

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:01.470
and it has cost much blood and pain
 before it was finished.

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.520
The giant sword it was forged from

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:07.970
symbolizes the hatred that runs 
through our clan, the Jingaitou.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:10.860
J-Jingaitou?

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:12.960
That's right.

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.170
And by impaling you with it,

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:18.480
we can continually kill the 
insect power within you.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:23.490
In other words, you're no more 
than a helpless child now.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:28.490
<i>I never knew there was any 
way to seal away my power.</i>

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:35.360
<i>My task of defending Japan has failed...</i>

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:42.490
Now, Insect Magistrate...

00:13:42.490 --> 00:13:45.010
How shall we kill you?

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.240
<i>Tsukishima?</i>

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:53.840
<i>He's alive?</i>

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.130
<i>Even after all those attacks?</i>

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.240
<i>Then I must get away...</i>

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.980
<i>Far away from him!</i>

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.370
No! I don't want to die yet!

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.780
It's too late for that.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.650
Don't disappoint me.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.530
No! Release me!

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:17.610
<i>This is good...</i>

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:20.290
<i>Now they'll focus on me, not on him.</i>

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:26.210
<i>Tsukishima, please survive!</i>

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.800
Hey, this samurai's still alive.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.740
What a pain in the ass.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.940
No! Stay away from him!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.280
I see...

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:44.530
This little insect matters that much to you.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:48.360
Then I'll chop him into pieces

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.090
before I kill you.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:53.700
D-Don't...

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:58.350
Magistrate, you will now learn 
how unfortunate it is,

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:00.590
having something to protect.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.630
S-Stop it!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:18.120
Mugai!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.600
I made it in time.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:22.350
Are you all right, Magistrate?

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:25.080
Yes.

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:27.110
But this Tsukishima

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:29.430
sacrificed himself for me.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.740
<i>Well done,</i>

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:35.720
<i>yam-boy!</i>

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:41.640
You've stopped us again!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.080
You traitor!

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:46.530
I'll kill you!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.680
Hurry! Get out of here!

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:54.810
But I cannot run...

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:57.680
Nope.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.680
You're going to die here—

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:04.630
Matsunohara!

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.590
The City Patrol?

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:08.820
<i>Matsukichi! Tamekichi!</i>

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.570
<i>Roll them up!</i>

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.800
<i>Full-Power Pull!</i>

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:18.230
Hell, no.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:19.450
<i>Armor Kick!</i>

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:26.920
<i>Repentance Slash.</i>

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.240
Get going...

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.840
I won't be satisfied unless I get 
to fight the Insect Hunters.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:35.970
Got it!

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.430
Wait...

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:39.560
I won't let you escape!

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:44.610
Nor will we.

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:47.440
You're going to die here.

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:53.850
Hold it!

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:57.200
Which one of you killed Okiku, 
the wife of Koikawa Sanosuke,

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.830
leader of the Black Spiders?

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.300
You... Who are you?

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:05.080
A fool who wishes to speed 
his journey into hell?

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.440
The Black Spiders?

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:10.340
Ah, that woman back then...

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:14.050
You guys, go on ahead.

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:16.500
It seems I should speak to him.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:18.700
Does that mean...

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.900
Yes.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:23.710
I killed that woman.

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:27.190
When I was removing people in 
our way, she got caught up in it.

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:31.470
Really...

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:33.070
So it was you?

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:40.080
Looks like it's time to drop 
the "Killer of 99" name.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:14.560
Time out!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.160
Three-sword style?

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:36.090
No matter how many,

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:38.410
they are no match for my jointed sword.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.590
Here I go.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.760
<i>Jointed Sword: Beautiful Flower!</i>

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:03.280
<i>Repentance Sword: Playback!</i>

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:24.510
Now I am the Killer of 100.

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:28.350
Insect Magistrate, I'm so glad you're safe.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.530
It's been a long time, Matsunohara.

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:32.580
I guess we cut it close...

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:33.430
Yes.

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:35.620
I shall give you the details later,

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.560
but at the moment, I cannot use my power.

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:39.780
Bear that in mind.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:40.630
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:44.900
I still can't believe that she's 
the Insect Magistrate.

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:47.040
What a pretty girl.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:50.520
By the way, is Tsukishima one of your men?

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.790
Did Jinbei-kun do something rude?

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:58.800
You did well, sending him to me.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.600
I found you!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:10.630
Insect Magistrate, I'll kill you!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.710
<i>Earthquake Hammer!</i>

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:19.740
Matsunohara!

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:22.600
Insect Magistrate!

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:29.510
What enormous power...

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:31.870
He shattered a mountain!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:34.880
Tenma!

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:40.090
Please escape on your own, Magistrate!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:47.260
I will not.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:53.270
This time, it is my turn.

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:00.960
I will not run away alone...

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:06.090
Let's go, Tsukishima!

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.670
We shall return to Edo together,

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:21.920
Tsukishima.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:24.560
Tsukishima!

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:02.650
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:59.930 --> 00:23:01.650
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:04.320
Jinbei's Power Awakens.

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:05.770
I can see it... I can see it!

00:23:05.770 --> 00:23:08.790
Koikawa-dono's three-sword style and Mugai-dono's swordsmanship.

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:11.920
Hibachi-dono, you got new underwear.

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Jinbei's Power Awakens!!</b>

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:14.000
Stay down!
